  'postContent' => 'That is not right. I would tell them if i have to change my location after you only host one wedding at a time and it seems that is not true. Then they need to give you a big discount on your wedding package. After you have already sent you invites out. And people have booked. Don\'t change your plans just because the resort made a mistake. Make them pay for it.',
