Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"205.173.217.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79475,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"552fa037843f7059abc000ad557f08f8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"JamaicaNicole\"] The Jambox is similar to the Pill, so personally I would just go with that. It was definitely loud enough, but honestly it&#039;s going to be the farthest thing from your mind at that point, so I&#039;d say save your money.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The DJ however is a MUST! Secrets picked the DJ. It was DJ Blu and I cannot express how much I loved this DJ. Hands down the BEST wedding DJ I have ever heard at ANY wedding. Seriously. My friends are STILL talking about him. Absolutely worth the $150\/per hour. Do it, and you won&#039;t regret it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"JamaicaNicole\"] The flowers were a different story. I was SUPER picky about those and didn&#039;t trust the wedding coordinators to convey exactly what I was looking for. Sooo, I hired Helen G events to do our bouquets, paid the stupid vendor fee, and it was still cheaper then going through the resort. She did exactly what I asked, and they came out perfect. I couldn&#039;t stop staring at them. I wanted to take them home to Oregon!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.helengevents.com\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.helengevents.com\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1902120,"PostDate":1438981719,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279353\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279353-jamaicanicole\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">JamaicaNicole<\/span><\/a> The Jambox is similar to the Pill, so personally I would just go with that. It was definitely loud enough, but honestly it's going to be the farthest thing from your mind at that point, so I'd say save your money.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The DJ however is a MUST! Secrets picked the DJ. It was DJ Blu and I cannot express how much I loved this DJ. Hands down the BEST wedding DJ I have ever heard at ANY wedding. Seriously. My friends are STILL talking about him. Absolutely worth the $150\/per hour. Do it, and you won't regret it.\u00a0<\/p>\n<br \/><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279353\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279353-jamaicanicole\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">JamaicaNicole<\/span><\/a> The flowers were a different story. I was SUPER picky about those and didn't trust the wedding coordinators to convey exactly what I was looking for. Sooo, I hired Helen G events to do our bouquets, paid the stupid vendor fee, and it was still cheaper then going through the resort. She did exactly what I asked, and they came out perfect. I couldn't stop staring at them. I wanted to take them home to Oregon!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.helengevents.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.helengevents.com\/<\/a><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cora4600@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"205.173.217.10","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1380213689,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273789.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":115,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cora4600","Id":273789,"Name":"cora4600","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.87.42.110","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79475,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a66139a240a7722c53cc40785443b78c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thank you so much for all of the feedback you have been so helpful! Did you get the DJ for 3 hours so just for the reception and not for the ceremony or cocktail hour.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1902121,"PostDate":1438981754,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thank you so much for all of the feedback you have been so helpful! Did you get the DJ for 3 hours so just for the reception and not for the ceremony or cocktail hour.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nicolechin4@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"68.87.42.110","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1407440509,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"JamaicaNicole","Id":279353,"Name":"JamaicaNicole","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"205.173.217.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79475,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"79dc32d53956e2228c397e9299996b4d","RawContent":"[quote name=\"JamaicaNicole\" post=\"1902121\" timestamp=\"1438978154\"]\nThank you so much for all of the feedback you have been so helpful! Did you get the DJ for 3 hours so just for the reception and not for the ceremony or cocktail hour.[\/quote]\n\nWe paid for just the reception, since we upgraded to the Steel Drum Band for the cocktail hour.... that was also worth the $200.","Attachments":[],"Id":1902122,"PostDate":1438981865,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>JamaicaNicole, on 07 August 2015 - 01:09 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Thank you so much for all of the feedback you have been so helpful! Did you get the DJ for 3 hours so just for the reception and not for the ceremony or cocktail hour.\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We paid for just the reception, since we upgraded to the Steel Drum Band for the cocktail hour.... that was also worth the $200.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cora4600@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"205.173.217.10","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1380213689,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273789.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":115,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cora4600","Id":273789,"Name":"cora4600","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.87.42.110","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79475,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ab1e53f27928667f957c80363e1fe55b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Uhh I know I completely agree about the vendor fee just because you choose to use someone else then them you get dinged with $300. I have an outside photographer coming in and have to pay it for that on top of a day pass.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1902123,"PostDate":1438981875,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Uhh I know I completely agree about the vendor fee just because you choose to use someone else then them you get dinged with $300. I have an outside photographer coming in and have to pay it for that on top of a day pass.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nicolechin4@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"68.87.42.110","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1407440509,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"JamaicaNicole","Id":279353,"Name":"JamaicaNicole","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"205.173.217.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79475,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ddb4bd9fab726d5e7a074ba90da17ea1","RawContent":"[quote name=\"JamaicaNicole\" post=\"1902123\" timestamp=\"1438978275\"]\nUhh I know I completely agree about the vendor fee just because you choose to use someone else then them you get dinged with $300. I have an outside photographer coming in and have to pay it for that on top of a day pass.[\/quote]\n\nSo we used an outside photographer as well and I know we paid the vendor fee, but I honestly want to say that they didn&#039;t charge us for the day passes. I&#039;d have to go home tonight and look at our final invoice to be sure, but I think it was just the $300 for the vendor fee. Also I didn&#039;t tell them about the flowers until we got there, and Helen was delivering them only, so I was able to talk them down to $100 for a vendor fee, so that worked in my favor.","Attachments":[],"Id":1902125,"PostDate":1438982863,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>JamaicaNicole, on 07 August 2015 - 01:11 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Uhh I know I completely agree about the vendor fee just because you choose to use someone else then them you get dinged with $300. I have an outside photographer coming in and have to pay it for that on top of a day pass.\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So we used an outside photographer as well and I know we paid the vendor fee, but I honestly want to say that they didn't charge us for the day passes. I'd have to go home tonight and look at our final invoice to be sure, but I think it was just the $300 for the vendor fee. Also I didn't tell them about the flowers until we got there, and Helen was delivering them only, so I was able to talk them down to $100 for a vendor fee, so that worked in my favor.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cora4600@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"205.173.217.10","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1380213689,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273789.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":115,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cora4600","Id":273789,"Name":"cora4600","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.249.52.69","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79475,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"651582b56556fbc9e7a260488535b679","RawContent":"[quote name=\"cora4600\" post=\"1902125\" timestamp=\"1438979263\"]\nSo we used an outside photographer as well and I know we paid the vendor fee, but I honestly want to say that they didn&#039;t charge us for the day passes. I&#039;d have to go home tonight and look at our final invoice to be sure, but I think it was just the $300 for the vendor fee. Also I didn&#039;t tell them about the flowers until we got there, and Helen was delivering them only, so I was able to talk them down to $100 for a vendor fee, so that worked in my favor.\n[\/quote]Please let me know because when I reached out to them they said it would be $380 total $300 vendor and and $80 day pass. That is ridiculous they charged you even the $100 just for her dropping them off I think the vendor fee is ridiculous. We are spending so much money already and they are going to charge us a penalty fee for using someone other than the resort for a vendor that is not right. My cousin got married in Punta Cana and just had to pay the day pass that&#039;s it.","Attachments":[],"Id":1902127,"PostDate":1438992295,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>cora4600, on 07 August 2015 - 01:27 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>So we used an outside photographer as well and I know we paid the vendor fee, but I honestly want to say that they didn't charge us for the day passes. I'd have to go home tonight and look at our final invoice to be sure, but I think it was just the $300 for the vendor fee. Also I didn't tell them about the flowers until we got there, and Helen was delivering them only, so I was able to talk them down to $100 for a vendor fee, so that worked in my favor.<br><\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nPlease let me know because when I reached out to them they said it would be $380 total $300 vendor and and $80 day pass. That is ridiculous they charged you even the $100 just for her dropping them off I think the vendor fee is ridiculous. We are spending so much money already and they are going to charge us a penalty fee for using someone other than the resort for a vendor that is not right. My cousin got married in Punta Cana and just had to pay the day pass that's it. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nicolechin4@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"68.87.42.110","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1407440509,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"JamaicaNicole","Id":279353,"Name":"JamaicaNicole","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"107.77.97.118","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79475,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a250932e4d17523095275d551434f65d","RawContent":"[quote name=\"JamaicaNicole\" post=\"1902127\" timestamp=\"1438988695\"]\nPlease let me know because when I reached out to them they said it would be $380 total $300 vendor and and $80 day pass. That is ridiculous they charged you even the $100 just for her dropping them off I think the vendor fee is ridiculous. We are spending so much money already and they are going to charge us a penalty fee for using someone other than the resort for a vendor that is not right. My cousin got married in Punta Cana and just had to pay the day pass that&#039;s it.[\/quote]\nSo I just looked and they did charge us the $380. I think maybe what I was thinking of is we had two photographers so they only charged us for the one and I had budgeted for two. So at least it was something.","Attachments":[],"Id":1902137,"PostDate":1439006785,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>JamaicaNicole, on 07 August 2015 - 04:04 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Please let me know because when I reached out to them they said it would be $380 total $300 vendor and and $80 day pass. That is ridiculous they charged you even the $100 just for her dropping them off I think the vendor fee is ridiculous. We are spending so much money already and they are going to charge us a penalty fee for using someone other than the resort for a vendor that is not right. My cousin got married in Punta Cana and just had to pay the day pass that's it.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nSo I just looked and they did charge us the $380. I think maybe what I was thinking of is we had two photographers so they only charged us for the one and I had budgeted for two. So at least it was something. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cora4600@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"205.173.217.10","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1380213689,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273789.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":115,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cora4600","Id":273789,"Name":"cora4600","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.249.52.69","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79475,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"933aecbea939e59c07596093dc92dee5","RawContent":"Thank you for looking into that, sorry just one more question how many people were at each table.","Attachments":[],"Id":1902146,"PostDate":1439046373,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thank you for looking into that, sorry just one more question how many people were at each table. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nicolechin4@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"68.87.42.110","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1407440509,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"JamaicaNicole","Id":279353,"Name":"JamaicaNicole","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"107.77.97.118","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79475,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"225a2b140dd86d79f336a1467fedf325","RawContent":"[quote name=\"JamaicaNicole\" post=\"1902146\" timestamp=\"1439042773\"]\nThank you for looking into that, sorry just one more question how many people were at each table.[\/quote]\nThe tables are 72\" and seat 10 people. I think we had 8-9 at each to give a little more room","Attachments":[],"Id":1902153,"PostDate":1439060510,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>JamaicaNicole, on 08 August 2015 - 07:06 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Thank you for looking into that, sorry just one more question how many people were at each table.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nThe tables are 72\" and seat 10 people. I think we had 8-9 at each to give a little more room\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cora4600@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"205.173.217.10","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1380213689,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273789.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":115,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cora4600","Id":273789,"Name":"cora4600","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.42.251","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79475,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2932f71ec80400e3bbe7ec33d6cf5440","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"cora4600\"] Congrats on your wedding and thanks for posting a review! It&#039;s always helpful for the brides on the site when they get to read about other brides&#039; experiences.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Your photos are gorgeous! Who did your photography? I&#039;m a Jamaican bride too but October 2011 and we were at Gran Bahia Principe Jamaica in Runaway Bay. We loved Jamaica and fell in love with the island.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1902196,"PostDate":1439176527,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"273789\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/273789-cora4600\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">cora4600<\/span><\/a> Congrats on your wedding and thanks for posting a review! It's always helpful for the brides on the site when they get to read about other brides' experiences.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Your photos are gorgeous! Who did your photography? I'm a Jamaican bride too but October 2011 and we were at Gran Bahia Principe Jamaica in Runaway Bay. We loved Jamaica and fell in love with the island.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283462599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":37,"TotalPages":4,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":30},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
