> User Toyal (284663)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"172.73.7.39","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79475,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f4d2ec84f94678d98efcc5612b1d5402","RawContent":"Thank you So Much for your post. Getting married at SWO in a little over 3 months. \n\nWondering is it better to tell the wedding coordinator everything I want in advance, or wait till the last minute. I want the steel drum band for the cocktail hour, but when I mentioned this she told me it was $1500. \n\nI love your cake. I thought it would just be a plain blank cake.","Attachments":[],"Id":1902201,"PostDate":1439210739,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thank you So Much for your post. Getting married at SWO in a little over 3 months. <br>\nWondering is it better to tell the wedding coordinator everything I want in advance, or wait till the last minute. I want the steel drum band for the cocktail hour, but when I mentioned this she told me it was $1500. <br>\nI love your cake. I thought it would just be a plain blank cake.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pinkiesup08@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.181.5.152","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1374617724,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271841.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RandL2015","Id":271841,"Name":"RandL2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"63.239.65.11","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79475,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"40476288b5a0da42b4d864824374a122","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thankk you @[member=\"cora4600\"] your reviews\/tips and these posts were SOOOOO useful.&amp;nbsp; i&#039;m getting married there 10\/2.&amp;nbsp; Your answers really helped me.&amp;nbsp; Even though Im going through some \"issues\" with the wedding crew there right now.&amp;nbsp; Your&amp;nbsp;comments sort of help me feel a little more positive about things.&amp;nbsp; Because I have been lately regretting choosing this resort.&amp;nbsp; Thanks so much.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Ladies lets try to keep this thread going?&amp;nbsp; For some reason There&#039;s not alot out here on SECRETS Montego Bay&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1902212,"PostDate":1439219333,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thankk you @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"273789\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/273789-cora4600\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">cora4600<\/span><\/a> your reviews\/tips and these posts were SOOOOO useful.\u00a0 i'm getting married there 10\/2.\u00a0 Your answers really helped me.\u00a0 Even though Im going through some \"issues\" with the wedding crew there right now.\u00a0 Your\u00a0comments sort of help me feel a little more positive about things.\u00a0 Because I have been lately regretting choosing this resort.\u00a0 Thanks so much.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Ladies lets try to keep this thread going?\u00a0 For some reason There's not alot out here on SECRETS Montego Bay<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"soon2bmzbrooks@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.87.82.62","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423516300,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Soon2bmzbrooks","Id":282051,"Name":"Soon2bmzbrooks","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"205.173.217.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79475,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c52a8dc15d82c7e4a94af6428d8a4db1","RawContent":"[quote name=\"acw271011\" post=\"1902196\" timestamp=\"1439172927\"]\n@[member=\"cora4600\"] Congrats on your wedding and thanks for posting a review! It&#039;s always helpful for the brides on the site when they get to read about other brides&#039; experiences.\n\nYour photos are gorgeous! Who did your photography? I&#039;m a Jamaican bride too but October 2011 and we were at Gran Bahia Principe Jamaica in Runaway Bay. We loved Jamaica and fell in love with the island.[\/quote]\nThanks! We had WPA do our photography and Rounald was great! \n[quote name=\"RandL2015\" post=\"1902201\" timestamp=\"1439207139\"]\nThank you So Much for your post. Getting married at SWO in a little over 3 months.\nWondering is it better to tell the wedding coordinator everything I want in advance, or wait till the last minute. I want the steel drum band for the cocktail hour, but when I mentioned this she told me it was $1500.\nI love your cake. I thought it would just be a plain blank cake.[\/quote]\nThat&#039;s so weird! We only had to pay the $200 for the upgrade for the band. I wonder what package you are getting? For a couple of the things I waited until we got there, since I kinda wanted to get a feel for what things looked like, but for everything else, I had let them know prior to arrival. About a month prior they sent my a \"Banquet Invoice\" and it detailed the total cost of everything that that was super helpful. \n[quote name=\"Soon2bmzbrooks\" post=\"1902212\" timestamp=\"1439215733\"]\nThankk you @[member=\"cora4600\"] your reviews\/tips and these posts were SOOOOO useful.  i&#039;m getting married there 10\/2.  Your answers really helped me.  Even though Im going through some \"issues\" with the wedding crew there right now.  Your comments sort of help me feel a little more positive about things.  Because I have been lately regretting choosing this resort.  Thanks so much. \nLadies lets try to keep this thread going?  For some reason There&#039;s not alot out here on SECRETS Montego Bay[\/quote]\nGood I&#039;m glad they helped! I had to scour the interwebs to learn stuff about Secrets Montego Bay, so I was right there with you, it was so frustrating! So please let me know if you have any other questions! \n\nI will also add that as much as I was frustrated about the lack of communication leading up to the wedding from the Coordinators, I can honestly tell you that they know what they are doing. The whole weekend (we did a welcome bonfire the night before) went off without a hitch, and she did things, or set thing up (like a shoe rack for all the guest since it was on the beach) that I would have never thought about. So as hard is this will be to accept.... trust them. I had the best time, with zero stress the day of. Everything went perfectly, and the resort and location were everything I hoped they would be.","Attachments":[],"Id":1902213,"PostDate":1439220725,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>acw271011, on 09 August 2015 - 07:15 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"273789\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/273789-cora4600\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">cora4600<\/span><\/a> Congrats on your wedding and thanks for posting a review! It's always helpful for the brides on the site when they get to read about other brides' experiences.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Your photos are gorgeous! Who did your photography? I'm a Jamaican bride too but October 2011 and we were at Gran Bahia Principe Jamaica in Runaway Bay. We loved Jamaica and fell in love with the island.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks! We had WPA do our photography and Rounald was great!\u00a0<\/p><br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>RandL2015, on 10 August 2015 - 04:45 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Thank you So Much for your post. Getting married at SWO in a little over 3 months.<br>\nWondering is it better to tell the wedding coordinator everything I want in advance, or wait till the last minute. I want the steel drum band for the cocktail hour, but when I mentioned this she told me it was $1500.<br>\nI love your cake. I thought it would just be a plain blank cake.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>That's so weird! We only had to pay the $200 for the upgrade for the band. I wonder what package you are getting? For a couple of the things I waited until we got there, since I kinda wanted to get a feel for what things looked like, but for everything else, I had let them know prior to arrival. About a month prior they sent my a \"Banquet Invoice\" and it detailed the total cost of everything that that was super helpful.\u00a0<\/p><br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Soon2bmzbrooks, on 10 August 2015 - 07:08 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Thankk you @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"273789\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/273789-cora4600\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">cora4600<\/span><\/a> your reviews\/tips and these posts were SOOOOO useful.\u00a0 i'm getting married there 10\/2.\u00a0 Your answers really helped me.\u00a0 Even though Im going through some \"issues\" with the wedding crew there right now.\u00a0 Your\u00a0comments sort of help me feel a little more positive about things.\u00a0 Because I have been lately regretting choosing this resort.\u00a0 Thanks so much.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Ladies lets try to keep this thread going?\u00a0 For some reason There's not alot out here on SECRETS Montego Bay<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good I'm glad they helped! I had to scour the interwebs to learn stuff about Secrets Montego Bay, so I was right there with you, it was so frustrating! So please let me know if you have any other questions!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I will also add that as much as I was frustrated about the lack of communication leading up to the wedding from the Coordinators, I can honestly tell you that they know what they are doing. The whole weekend (we did a welcome bonfire the night before) went off without a hitch, and she did things, or set thing up (like a shoe rack for all the guest since it was on the beach) that I would have never thought about. So as hard is this will be to accept.... trust them. I had the best time, with zero stress the day of. Everything went perfectly, and the resort and location were everything I hoped they would be.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cora4600@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"205.173.217.10","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1380213689,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273789.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":115,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cora4600","Id":273789,"Name":"cora4600","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"63.239.65.11","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79475,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"689a5de9579aa05e5c84366a1af33bc6","RawContent":"[quote name=\"cora4600\" post=\"1902213\" timestamp=\"1439217125\"]\nThanks! We had WPA do our photography and Rounald was great! \n\n\nThat&#039;s so weird! We only had to pay the $200 for the upgrade for the band. I wonder what package you are getting? For a couple of the things I waited until we got there, since I kinda wanted to get a feel for what things looked like, but for everything else, I had let them know prior to arrival. About a month prior they sent my a \"Banquet Invoice\" and it detailed the total cost of everything that that was super helpful. \n\n\nGood I&#039;m glad they helped! I had to scour the interwebs to learn stuff about Secrets Montego Bay, so I was right there with you, it was so frustrating! So please let me know if you have any other questions! \n\nI will also add that as much as I was frustrated about the lack of communication leading up to the wedding from the Coordinators, I can honestly tell you that they know what they are doing. The whole weekend (we did a welcome bonfire the night before) went off without a hitch, and she did things, or set thing up (like a shoe rack for all the guest since it was on the beach) that I would have never thought about. So as hard is this will be to accept.... trust them. I had the best time, with zero stress the day of. Everything went perfectly, and the resort and location were everything I hoped they would be.[\/quote]  Whew!! I&#039;m glad it&#039;s just not me.  When I call them, I get the impression that my event is not important. They don&#039;t sound understanding at all.  This is very frustrating.   I can&#039;t wait to see your pics.  Im on the computer at work right now, and for some reason I&#039;m not able to view your pics.  But thank you again for your viewpoints.","Attachments":[],"Id":1902218,"PostDate":1439222659,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>cora4600, on 10 August 2015 - 07:32 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Thanks! We had WPA do our photography and Rounald was great!\u00a0<\/p>\n<br><p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>That's so weird! We only had to pay the $200 for the upgrade for the band. I wonder what package you are getting? For a couple of the things I waited until we got there, since I kinda wanted to get a feel for what things looked like, but for everything else, I had let them know prior to arrival. About a month prior they sent my a \"Banquet Invoice\" and it detailed the total cost of everything that that was super helpful.\u00a0<\/p>\n<br><p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good I'm glad they helped! I had to scour the interwebs to learn stuff about Secrets Montego Bay, so I was right there with you, it was so frustrating! So please let me know if you have any other questions!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I will also add that as much as I was frustrated about the lack of communication leading up to the wedding from the Coordinators, I can honestly tell you that they know what they are doing. The whole weekend (we did a welcome bonfire the night before) went off without a hitch, and she did things, or set thing up (like a shoe rack for all the guest since it was on the beach) that I would have never thought about. So as hard is this will be to accept.... trust them. I had the best time, with zero stress the day of. Everything went perfectly, and the resort and location were everything I hoped they would be.\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0 Whew!! I'm glad it's just not me.\u00a0 When I call them, I get the impression that my event is not important.\u00a0They don't sound understanding at all.\u00a0 This is very frustrating.\u00a0\u00a0 I can't wait to see your pics.\u00a0 Im on the computer at work right now, and for some reason I'm not able to view your pics.\u00a0\u00a0But thank you again for your viewpoints.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"soon2bmzbrooks@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.87.82.62","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423516300,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Soon2bmzbrooks","Id":282051,"Name":"Soon2bmzbrooks","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.69.133.20","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79475,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"510c4b821184a4c72be9233480a802b6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;As I get closer to my date, I know I will have more questions. &amp;nbsp;Just so happy, everything will be okay in the end.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1902226,"PostDate":1439231477,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>As I get closer to my date, I know I will have more questions. \u00a0Just so happy, everything will be okay in the end.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pinkiesup08@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.181.5.152","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1374617724,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271841.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RandL2015","Id":271841,"Name":"RandL2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"166.216.165.27","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79475,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"85f22e53a43d8267e466ca07e05aada8","RawContent":"I am planning on doing the welcome bonfire as well do you have any pictures I haven&#039;t been able to find many. Did you do the one with the dj and open bar. I saw one and it looked like they were just little burners instead of a huge fire with wood on the beach. Did you bring stuff for smores with you.","Attachments":[],"Id":1902264,"PostDate":1439300372,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I am planning on doing the welcome bonfire as well do you have any pictures I haven't been able to find many. Did you do the one with the dj and open bar. I saw one and it looked like they were just little burners instead of a huge fire with wood on the beach. Did you bring stuff for smores with you. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nicolechin4@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"68.87.42.110","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1407440509,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"JamaicaNicole","Id":279353,"Name":"JamaicaNicole","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"205.173.217.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79475,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d7cb2718c7a3640c374d3eec7494e980","RawContent":"[quote name=\"JamaicaNicole\" post=\"1902264\" timestamp=\"1439296772\"]\nI am planning on doing the welcome bonfire as well do you have any pictures I haven&#039;t been able to find many. Did you do the one with the dj and open bar. I saw one and it looked like they were just little burners instead of a huge fire with wood on the beach. Did you bring stuff for smores with you.[\/quote]\n\nNicole- We just did the bonfire. We had about 85 people there for the wedding, and I didn&#039;t feel like paying for booze again that night when everyone was already paying the all inclusive price. It was still nice though. The WC&#039;s set up cocktail tables and a bigger table for everyone&#039;s Welcome Bags. Honestly it was just a good place for everyone to converge and meet before the wedding since we had people from all walks of life that had not met yet. \n\nHonestly I&#039;m also not sure the smores would be worth bringing. The fire was off to the side (I&#039;m assuming as a safely precaution) so we really weren&#039;t close enough to even roast marshmallows. (I looked for photos but I don&#039;t really have any of the set-up since it was so dark, sorry!)","Attachments":[],"Id":1902275,"PostDate":1439311255,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>JamaicaNicole, on 11 August 2015 - 05:39 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I am planning on doing the welcome bonfire as well do you have any pictures I haven't been able to find many. Did you do the one with the dj and open bar. I saw one and it looked like they were just little burners instead of a huge fire with wood on the beach. Did you bring stuff for smores with you.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Nicole- We just did the bonfire. We had about 85 people there for the wedding, and I didn't feel like paying for booze again that night when everyone was already paying the all inclusive price. It was still nice though. The WC's set up cocktail tables and a bigger table for everyone's Welcome Bags. Honestly it was just a good place for everyone to converge and meet before the wedding since we had people from all walks of life that had not met yet.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Honestly I'm also not sure the smores would be worth bringing. The fire was off to the side (I'm assuming as a safely precaution) so we really weren't close enough to even roast marshmallows. (I looked for photos but I don't really have any of the set-up since it was so dark, sorry!)<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cora4600@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"205.173.217.10","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1380213689,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273789.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":115,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cora4600","Id":273789,"Name":"cora4600","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"205.173.217.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79475,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8b23a55d83d7ea4469f0c85d9d54e12a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Ok I did find a few more pics that might help.... funny how you don&#039;t realize that you don&#039;t have any pics of the details until you are trying to find them! Ha!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xft1\/v\/t1.0-9\/11873752_10207387967922614_5302476170860895295_n.jpg?oh=a7a27b47d5a4e8b3b44b10fcfd76db7d&amp;amp;oe=563F15CA\" alt=\"11873752_10207387967922614_5302476170860\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Shoe racks....&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xat1\/v\/t1.0-9\/11223317_10207387965162545_5599189010798352993_n.jpg?oh=602b3cbde88848d157cf44f1a3456b83&amp;amp;oe=563E51BE\" alt=\"11223317_10207387965162545_5599189010798\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xta1\/v\/t1.0-9\/11260691_10207387951962215_1947149412705784268_n.jpg?oh=b07debbd00bfe7c7c3287effdcb97db6&amp;amp;oe=564A343C\" alt=\"11260691_10207387951962215_1947149412705\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xap1\/v\/t1.0-9\/1507587_10205533879491562_2860740989442319424_n.jpg?oh=ca716026675291244e791375b4922913&amp;amp;oe=56802F14\" alt=\"1507587_10205533879491562_28607409894423\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfp1\/v\/t1.0-9\/11846687_10207387975442802_6286649868747798664_n.jpg?oh=76876d147543ae55b9fd0935d7e5f207&amp;amp;oe=567AC238\" alt=\"11846687_10207387975442802_6286649868747\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtp1\/v\/t1.0-9\/11863393_10207387975642807_6327968428013997540_n.jpg?oh=db88863aa7b7f6b7728ddd049ffe0f9d&amp;amp;oe=564018FC\" alt=\"11863393_10207387975642807_6327968428013\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtp1\/v\/t1.0-9\/11870642_10207387975402801_1870922931477805525_n.jpg?oh=d3243ecf843fd206469435156231a6ec&amp;amp;oe=567A32B3\" alt=\"11870642_10207387975402801_1870922931477\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xft1\/v\/t1.0-9\/1966774_10205533928652791_2802790084009054654_n.jpg?oh=3bf3e2133fa1f3058d54a3ebc5e1eb56&amp;amp;oe=563B9095\" alt=\"1966774_10205533928652791_28027900840090\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpf1\/v\/t1.0-9\/10431440_10205533927212755_5236327241237506058_n.jpg?oh=cecb92acc7bb1be33dd82d8ea0ba5d0e&amp;amp;oe=5680E6F6\" alt=\"10431440_10205533927212755_5236327241237\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xaf1\/v\/t1.0-9\/14595_10205533927652766_2846724495085131255_n.jpg?oh=eca520a7fd780f2e265569163bb6d54a&amp;amp;oe=5635BEFD\" alt=\"14595_10205533927652766_2846724495085131\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1902281,"PostDate":1439313507,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Ok I did find a few more pics that might help.... funny how you don't realize that you don't have any pics of the details until you are trying to find them! Ha!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xft1\/v\/t1.0-9\/11873752_10207387967922614_5302476170860895295_n.jpg?oh=a7a27b47d5a4e8b3b44b10fcfd76db7d&oe=563F15CA\" alt=\"11873752_10207387967922614_5302476170860\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Shoe racks....<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xat1\/v\/t1.0-9\/11223317_10207387965162545_5599189010798352993_n.jpg?oh=602b3cbde88848d157cf44f1a3456b83&oe=563E51BE\" alt=\"11223317_10207387965162545_5599189010798\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xta1\/v\/t1.0-9\/11260691_10207387951962215_1947149412705784268_n.jpg?oh=b07debbd00bfe7c7c3287effdcb97db6&oe=564A343C\" alt=\"11260691_10207387951962215_1947149412705\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xap1\/v\/t1.0-9\/1507587_10205533879491562_2860740989442319424_n.jpg?oh=ca716026675291244e791375b4922913&oe=56802F14\" alt=\"1507587_10205533879491562_28607409894423\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfp1\/v\/t1.0-9\/11846687_10207387975442802_6286649868747798664_n.jpg?oh=76876d147543ae55b9fd0935d7e5f207&oe=567AC238\" alt=\"11846687_10207387975442802_6286649868747\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtp1\/v\/t1.0-9\/11863393_10207387975642807_6327968428013997540_n.jpg?oh=db88863aa7b7f6b7728ddd049ffe0f9d&oe=564018FC\" alt=\"11863393_10207387975642807_6327968428013\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtp1\/v\/t1.0-9\/11870642_10207387975402801_1870922931477805525_n.jpg?oh=d3243ecf843fd206469435156231a6ec&oe=567A32B3\" alt=\"11870642_10207387975402801_1870922931477\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xft1\/v\/t1.0-9\/1966774_10205533928652791_2802790084009054654_n.jpg?oh=3bf3e2133fa1f3058d54a3ebc5e1eb56&oe=563B9095\" alt=\"1966774_10205533928652791_28027900840090\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpf1\/v\/t1.0-9\/10431440_10205533927212755_5236327241237506058_n.jpg?oh=cecb92acc7bb1be33dd82d8ea0ba5d0e&oe=5680E6F6\" alt=\"10431440_10205533927212755_5236327241237\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xaf1\/v\/t1.0-9\/14595_10205533927652766_2846724495085131255_n.jpg?oh=eca520a7fd780f2e265569163bb6d54a&oe=5635BEFD\" alt=\"14595_10205533927652766_2846724495085131\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cora4600@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"205.173.217.10","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1380213689,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273789.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":115,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cora4600","Id":273789,"Name":"cora4600","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.87.42.110","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79475,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1439322216,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c2c65eb501df17c2b6c0205cb705e3af","RawContent":"[quote name=\"cora4600\" post=\"1902275\" timestamp=\"1439307655\"]\nNicole- We just did the bonfire. We had about 85 people there for the wedding, and I didn&#039;t feel like paying for booze again that night when everyone was already paying the all inclusive price. It was still nice though. The WC&#039;s set up cocktail tables and a bigger table for everyone&#039;s Welcome Bags. Honestly it was just a good place for everyone to converge and meet before the wedding since we had people from all walks of life that had not met yet. \n\nHonestly I&#039;m also not sure the smores would be worth bringing. The fire was off to the side (I&#039;m assuming as a safely precaution) so we really weren&#039;t close enough to even roast marshmallows. (I looked for photos but I don&#039;t really have any of the set-up since it was so dark, sorry!)[\/quote]\n[size=3][background=rgb(247,247,247)]That is awesome that you had 85 people come and thank you again for all of your help! Was the bonfire big I saw a picture where it looked like just a smaller burner but maybe that was because they had smores they might have set that up on the side. Did they charge to set up the tables at the event for the wecome bags or the show racks. [\/background][\/size]","Attachments":[],"Id":1902289,"PostDate":1439322189,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>cora4600, on 11 August 2015 - 08:40 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Nicole- We just did the bonfire. We had about 85 people there for the wedding, and I didn't feel like paying for booze again that night when everyone was already paying the all inclusive price. It was still nice though. The WC's set up cocktail tables and a bigger table for everyone's Welcome Bags. Honestly it was just a good place for everyone to converge and meet before the wedding since we had people from all walks of life that had not met yet.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Honestly I'm also not sure the smores would be worth bringing. The fire was off to the side (I'm assuming as a safely precaution) so we really weren't close enough to even roast marshmallows. (I looked for photos but I don't really have any of the set-up since it was so dark, sorry!)<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\">That is awesome that you had 85 people come and thank you again for all of your help! Was the bonfire big I saw a picture where it looked like just a smaller burner but maybe that was because they had smores they might have set that up on the side. Did they charge to set up the tables at the event for the wecome bags or the show racks.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nicolechin4@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"68.87.42.110","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1407440509,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"JamaicaNicole","Id":279353,"Name":"JamaicaNicole","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"209.171.88.215","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79475,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e171a16c470665699943622caf9f8d4f","RawContent":"You look beauuuutiful!  Love your dress","Attachments":[],"Id":1902531,"PostDate":1439572302,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                You look beauuuutiful!  Love your dress\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My Planning Thread (Grand Sirenis 05.12.16)<a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79418-joannabananas-planning-thread-may-12th-2016-grand-sirenis\/\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79418-joannabananas-planning-thread-may-12th-2016-grand-sirenis\/<\/a><p><br><br><br><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/t\/wSWQNi0\/weight.png\" alt=\"weight.png\"><br><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;484\/st\/20160512\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/f153\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\">","Email":"joanne.aguiar@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.234.116.105","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1424060509,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282128.jpg?_r=1441196917","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":203,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JoannaBanana","Id":282128,"Name":"JoannaBanana","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":37,"TotalPages":4,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":30},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
